<main>
	<section>
		<h2>What makes this Book unique?</h2>
		<p>In this book, the author Casey brings together his two backgrounds:</p>
		<ol>
			<li><strong>Neuroscience</strong> at Yale University</li>
			<li><strong>Software Development</strong> for 10+ years</li>
		</ol>

		<p>
			You'll learn psychology concepts like Cognitive Behavioral Therapy (CBT)
			via software development metaphors.
		</p>
	</section>
